      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "• Doble Envio -> Redis Idempotency Key TTL 24h\n• Provider Timeout -> PENDING_RECONCILIATION\n• Webhook Duplicado -> Unique Constraint event_id\n• Webhook Fuera de Orden -> Monotonic Versioning\n• Caida Analytics -> DLQ Kafka (Read-Only Eventual)\n• Caida Notif -> Outbox Pattern Replay",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "9cIzQVrBplv9ZwlX",
      "originalText": "• Doble Envio -> Redis Idempotency Key TTL 24h\n• Provider Timeout -> PENDING_RECONCILIATION\n• Webhook Duplicado -> Unique Constraint event_id\n• Webhook Fuera de Orden -> Monotonic Versioning\n• Caida Analytics -> DLQ Kafka (Read-Only Eventual)\n• Caida Notif -> Outbox Pattern Replay",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "aI"
    }
